node_modules/

# `**/` prefix is load-bearing: a pattern containing a mid-string `/` is
# anchored to the repo root, so the un-prefixed form stopped matching once the
# plugin moved under apps/streamdeck/.
**/io.github.aguilarguisado.siestadeck.sdPlugin/bin/
**/io.github.aguilarguisado.siestadeck.sdPlugin/logs/
*.streamDeckPlugin
.DS_Store
.vscode/
*.log

# Built PNGs are regenerated from apps/streamdeck/assets/icons/*.svg via `npm run icons`.
**/io.github.aguilarguisado.siestadeck.sdPlugin/imgs/

# Test coverage output
coverage/

# Local Claude Code state (skill output, brand-kit metadata, etc.)
.claude/
